1 crore Letter of Acceptance from Northeast Frontier Railway** for an optical-fibre backbone under KAVACH","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ANNU2025_06102026113516_Announcement.pdf","mcap":295.5,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ANNU2025_06102026113516_Announcement.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Transrail Lighting** — secures **new T&D orders worth Rs 412 crore**, mainly HTLS transmission-line reconductoring, taking FY order intake to Rs 2,021 crore; a further Rs 409 crore of L1 positions are not yet awarded _(~6.6% of mcap)_.","**Capacit'e Infraprojects** — receives a **Rs 368.98 crore (excl. GST) Letter of Acceptance from Chennai Metro Rail** for buildings near Thirumangalam Metro Station, covering civil, finishes, MEP and lifts _(~24.4% of mcap)_.","**Solex Energy** — wholly owned subsidiary Solex Green Energy wins a **Rs 180.98 crore (incl. taxes) order for TOPCon bifacial glass-to-glass solar modules** from an undisclosed domestic power-sector entity, due by January 2027 _(~24.6% of mcap)_.","**Om Power Transmission** — receives a **Letter of Intent from Gujarat Energy Transmission Corporation for Rs 69.18 crore (incl. GST)** to build the 220 kV D/C Prantij-Jantral line (Package 2) on a turnkey basis, over 24 months _(~13.3% of mcap)_.","**Shakti Pumps** — receives a **Letter of Empanelment from MSEDCL for 4,755 off-grid solar water pumps worth ~Rs 112.18 crore incl. GST** (Rs 103.01 cr ex-GST); the 60-day execution clock starts only when the work order is issued _(~2.0% of mcap)_.","**Interarch Building Solutions** — wins a **~Rs 61 crore (incl. taxes) pre-engineered steel building order for a copper refinery in Gujarat** from an undisclosed domestic customer, over ~12 months with a 20% advance _(~2.2% of mcap)_.","**Annu Projects** — receives a **Rs 12.81 crore Letter of Acceptance from Northeast Frontier Railway** for a 4x48-fibre optical backbone over 143 route-km in Tinsukia division under KAVACH, over 24 months _(~4.3% of mcap)_.","**Mphasis** — signs an **agreement worth approximately £35.4 million with Social Security Scotland** to manage and maintain its core benefits case-management platform, which serves about 2 million citizens."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**PTC Industries** — board approves June-quarter interim consolidated financials for the placement document of its **proposed Qualified Institutions Placement** of equity shares; the issue size is not stated."],"m_and_a":["**KNR Constructions** — completes the sale of its **entire stake in KNR Ramanattukara Infra to Indus Infra Trust, receiving Rs 549.14 crore** against Rs 225.72 crore invested; the SPV ceased to be a subsidiary on 5 October _(~17.4% of mcap)_.","**Adani Power** — signs a shareholders' agreement with Bhutan's state utility Druk Green Power to build the **770 MW Chamkharchhu hydropower project** through a 49:51 joint venture, initially taking 4.9 million shares at BTN 100 each.","**Marsons** — board approves a **joint venture with New York private-equity firm Cleanhill Partners** to sell and service its transformers in the US and Canada, and later manufacture there, subject to a definitive agreement (value not disclosed).","**Kabra Extrusiontechnik** — incorporates **Geon International FZ-LLC in Ras Al Khaimah, UAE, with AED 3.9 million of share capital**, a holding company for its planned battery-pack manufacturing subsidiary in Vietnam.","**Privi Speciality Chemicals** — NCLT Mumbai convenes a **shareholders' meeting on 27 October** to vote on merging group companies Privi Fine Sciences and Privi Biotechnologies into the company; creditor meetings were dispensed with."],"capex_core":["**JSW Cement** — commissions an **additional 1 MTPA grinding unit at Nagaur, Rajasthan**, taking that plant to 3.5 MTPA and its total grinding capacity to 25.1 MTPA.","**Godrej Consumer Products** — its Indonesian subsidiary opens phase one of a new Kendal SEZ plant, part of an **IDR 500 billion (approx. Rs 250 crore, per the filing) investment** that adds about 15% to home and personal care capacity.","**Godawari Power & Ispat** — subsidiary Godawari New Energy receives **environment clearance to build the facility for its 20 GWh battery energy storage system project** at AURIC Bidkin, Maharashtra.","**LEAP India** — remits **USD 1 million (~Rs 9.64 crore, per the filing)** as further equity into UAE subsidiary LEAP MENA Holdings, to fund pallet-pooling assets and working capital at its operating arm."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 6 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Max Estates** — reports **H1 FY27 pre-sales of ~Rs 3,200 crore**, including ~Rs 2,100 crore in Q2 against Rs 156 crore a year earlier, with Q2 collections of ~Rs 560 crore.","**United Breweries** — receives **income-tax refunds of Rs 100.83 crore** for AY 2013-14 and AY 2020-21, including Rs 30.44 crore of interest (our sum); appeals on the remaining issues continue.","**H.G. Infra Engineering** — Karnataka's Deputy Commissioner of Commercial Taxes **drops a Rs 94 crore demand in full**, closing the show-cause proceedings at nil tax, interest and penalty.","**MBL Infrastructure** — Dehradun's Commercial Court orders Uttarakhand's Public Works Department to **deposit Rs 81.14 crore under a December 2024 arbitration award**, with 12% annual interest running until payment.","**Tata Chemicals** — the Supreme Court **bars the Gujarat government from coercive action** over its legacy wastewater channels at Mithapur and seeks the state's response.","**Indian Energy Exchange** — Q2 FY27 electricity traded volume rises **12.7% YoY to 39.7 BU**, with September up 10.4% to 12.2 BU.","**Angel One** — September client base grows **17.3% YoY to 39.98 million** and the average client funding book **41.7% to Rs 78.71 billion**, while gross client acquisition falls 17.1%.","**Steel Exchange India** — records its **highest-ever rebar output: 25,095 MT in September and 69,617 MT in Q2 FY27**, after commissioning a reheating furnace.","**Shyam Metalics and Energy** — September stainless-steel sales volume rises **35.06% YoY to 9,778 MT**, at an average realisation of Rs 1,68,803 per tonne.","**Meesho** — says **Content Commerce net merchandise value grew 152% YoY**, driven by 1.6 lakh active creators, 90% of them nano creators.","**Lupin** — launches **Formoflo-G MDI in India** after DCGI approval, which it calls the world's first fixed-dose triple-combination inhaler for COPD.","**Glenmark Pharmaceuticals** — its US arm launches **Adapalene Gel 0.1% (OTC) in pump packs**, a Differin OTC market of about $45.8 million a year per Nielsen.","**Cyient** — forms a new **Intelligent Engineering Solutions business unit** under Harjott Atrii and launches CYiNGINE, its AI-based lifecycle engineering platform.","**Patel Retail** — launches a **23-product whole-spices range under its Indian Chaska brand**, made at its Kutch, Gujarat facility."],"distress_risk":["**IL&FS Engineering and Construction** — after Committee of Creditors approval of the resolution proposal, the IL&FS board **clears filing it with NCLT Mumbai** for approval.","**Osia Hyper Retail** — its Resolution Professional publishes **Form G inviting expressions of interest** from prospective resolution applicants under the company's ongoing insolvency process.","**Smartlink Holdings** — subsidiary Digisol receives a **GST show-cause notice proposing Rs 1.77 crore of tax**, plus Rs 1.41 crore interest and Rs 0.18 crore penalty, for FY 2022-23; it will reply.","**Craftsman Automation** — a Jamshedpur GST officer **demands Rs 0.69 crore of tax plus an equal penalty and interest** for FY22-FY23 over excess input-tax credit; the company plans to appeal."],"credit_rating_changes":["**HP Telecom India** — CARE **upgrades its long-term bank-facility rating two notches to BBB+/Stable from BBB-/Positive** and its short-term rating to A2 from A3."],"other_notable":["**Grand Foundry** — files a revised CA certificate for its **proposed change of name to Tikona Communication Limited**, to accompany the notice of its upcoming EGM."],"open_offers":["**Hiliks Technologies Ltd** — open offer PA filed — not in the corp_events ledger yet (next cycle)"]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes","other_notable":"Other notable","open_offers":"Open offers (PA)"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TRANSRAIL_06102026101401_TLLPressrelease06102026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/CAPACITE_06102026134054_WorkOrderChennaiMetrorailf.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SOLEX_06102026121952_Intimation_of_Work_Order.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/OMPOWER_06102026170500_V0_Intimation_receipt_of_order.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SHAKTIPUMP_06102026122041_LetterofEmpanelmentfromMSEDCL.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/INTERARCH1983_06102026122104_IntimationunderRegulation30BaggingAward06102026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ANNU2025_06102026113516_Announcement.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/MPHASIS_06102026153914_Press_Release-6_October_2026_Sd.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null}],"fund_raises_fresh_eq